    "text": "國造潛艦海空號仍在測試階段",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1126.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "施暴者在保護令核發前稱為相對人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1129.98,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "保護令核發後就改稱為加害人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1133.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而如何辨識高風險的相對人與加害人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1136.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "相關單位極度重視",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1138.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在保護令核發後的第一時間",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1141.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "加害人若情緒很激動",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1143.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "往往是危機的徵兆",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1145.98,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "保護鏈必須緊縮且同時掌握資訊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1156.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但社工認為跨機構協作",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1158.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不只要能同時掌握資訊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1160.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "更要有默契",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1162.98,
    "duration": 23,
    "text": "但加暴和一般單一犯罪事件不同",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1185.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "重犯率高 風險倍增",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1187.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "法令必須與時間賽跑",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1212.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "現行保護令必須在執行速度",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1215.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "風險防控及跨機關協作等層次上",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1218.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "全面升級 才能支出夠綿密的防護網",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1221.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "接觸受害人 公視新聞萬真文",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1224.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "黃真淵採訪報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1227.98,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "昨天是世界心臟日",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1231.98,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "根據觀察 近年四十到六十歲的男性",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1235.98,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "心肌梗塞發生率大幅的提升",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1239.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "臨床上也出現心臟病患者",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1242.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "有年齡下降的趨勢",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1245.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "醫師提醒 最主要的危險因子",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1248.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "就是高血壓和吸菸",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1251.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "如果出現胸悶 胸痛",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1253.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "最好儘早就醫",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1256.98,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "在專業人員輔導之下",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1262.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "民眾接續練習 CPR",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1264.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "九月二十九日被稱為世界心臟日",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1266.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "專家提醒 近年出現心臟病患者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1269.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "年齡降低的趨勢",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1272.98,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "醫師分享 有四十歲男性個案",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1284.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "因為冠狀動脈中的左前醬汁堵塞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1287.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "嫌疑客還在唱歌 卻突然發病",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1290.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也有一名四十二歲小池店老闆娘",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1292.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "肚子不舒服 以為是腸胃問題",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1295.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "拖了兩三天 突然休克",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1297.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "才發現是心肌梗塞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1299.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "甚至接觸過年僅三十五歲的年輕患者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1302.98,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "根據世界衛生組織統計",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1307.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "新血管疾病每年奪走兩千零",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1309.98,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "五十萬條性命",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1310.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "位居全球死亡原因第一名",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1313.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "心臟基金會也觀察 近年四十到六十歲",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1316.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "男性心肌梗塞發生率大幅提升",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.98,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "另外也特別提醒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1320.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "絕對不能忽視吸菸這項危險因子",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1325.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "最常見的症狀當然就是胸口的不舒服",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.98,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "這個是常見",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1329.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但是他的表現其實是千變萬化",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1331.98,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "在臺灣五十歲以下的人發生心肌梗塞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1335.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "最重要的原因有兩個",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1337.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一個就是吸菸 一個就是膽固醇高",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1340.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因為三四十歲的症狀",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.98,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "他可能沒有高血壓",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1343.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他也沒有糖尿病 心臟基金會指出",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1346.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "吸菸者發生心臟疾病",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1348.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "包括心肌梗塞 心腳痛等疾病",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1350.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "風險高於沒吸菸者二到四倍",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1353.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "呼籲若有三高或家族病史的民眾",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1355.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "要儘早戒菸",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1357.98,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "另外也要規律運動",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1358.98,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "定期監測血壓",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1359.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "隨時監測心律 冤勵及病危險",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1362.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "觀眾臺北報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1365.98,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "關心天氣 接著提供您各地的氣象資料",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1383.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "感謝您收看這一節的公視手語新聞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1386.98,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "我們下集節目再見",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1413.98,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "我是吳嘉瑜 明天同一時間再會",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1443.98,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "MING PAO CANADA | MING PAO TORONTO",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  }
